From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vasiliy Telezhnikov <vasilyt@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 12:35:04 -0700
Subject: Don't support partial clearing in WritePixels

Partially cleared images are not really a thing from perspective of
anything except validating command decoder.

All call-sites except Canvas2D [1] always overwrite whole image.
Canvas2D calls it only if it's accelerated [2], which always clears
resource at creation time [3] and initialized all subsequent resources
with copy-on-write from previous ones [4], it always should have shared
image initialized.

[1]
https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/canvas_2d_resource_provider.cc;drc=42b8c15629420815a0264116d52e0492dfe7aea9;l=301
[2]
https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/canvas_2d_resource_provider.cc;drc=42b8c15629420815a0264116d52e0492dfe7aea9;l=274
[3]
https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/canvas_2d_resource_provider.cc;drc=42b8c15629420815a0264116d52e0492dfe7aea9;l=804
[4]
https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/platform/graphics/canvas_2d_resource_provider.cc;drc=42b8c15629420815a0264116d52e0492dfe7aea9;l=227

Bug: 536663516
Change-Id: I90fdafaed28827081f3ab353667380145471385b
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8450359
Commit-Queue: Vasiliy Telezhnikov <vasilyt@chromium.org>
Reviewed-by: Kyle Charbonneau <kylechar@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1703666}

diff --git a/gpu/command_buffer/service/raster_decoder.cc b/gpu/command_buffer/service/raster_decoder.cc
index b340484f81453e5ca1592ac95e8a92b7f17d9073..d965c2df7cdec0bfabcc80ca98ef2795bff08c04 100644
--- a/gpu/command_buffer/service/raster_decoder.cc
+++ b/gpu/command_buffer/service/raster_decoder.cc
@@ -2014,8 +2014,7 @@ void RasterDecoderImpl::DoWritePixelsINTERNAL(GLint x_offset,
           return;
         }
       }
-      dest_shared_image->SetClearedRect(
-          gfx::Rect(src_info.width(), src_info.height()));
+      dest_shared_image->SetCleared();
     }
     return;
   }
@@ -2078,8 +2077,11 @@ void RasterDecoderImpl::DoWritePixelsINTERNAL(GLint x_offset,
         return;
       }
     }
-    dest_shared_image->SetClearedRect(
-        gfx::Rect(x_offset, y_offset, src_width, src_height));
+
+    if (gfx::Rect(x_offset, y_offset, src_width, src_height)
+            .Contains(gfx::Rect(dest_shared_image->size()))) {
+      dest_shared_image->SetCleared();
+    }
   }
 }
 
